# ai-logs .gitignore: credential files that session/config exports must never include.
# Proposed 2026-10-05 by the ailogs-secrets checklist-prep run.
# Note: these patterns stop credential FILES. They cannot stop secrets pasted into
# transcript CONTENT (DeepSeek, Brave and the deployer key leaked that way); run the
# secret scan as a pre-commit / pre-push gate for that.

# Pi agent credentials and provider keys
**/pi/auth.json
**/pi/agent/auth.json
**/web-search.json

# Claude Code credentials, daemon and per-session IPC keys
**/.credentials.json
**/daemon/control.key
**/daemon/*.key
**/claude/sessions/*.key
*.key
# optional, uncomment to also drop (tracked today; PII or lock files, not credentials):
# **/.oauth_refresh.lock*
# .claude.json
# **/backups/.claude.json.backup.*

# Codex / OpenAI CLI auth
**/.codex/auth.json
auth.json

# GitHub CLI, noti, telegram channel, wallet and generic env files
**/gh/hosts.yml
**/noti/config.json
**/channels/telegram/.env
**/vps-wallet.env
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!*.env.example
!.env.dist
!.env.*.public
!.env.public

# Keys and keystores
*.pem
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.keystore
keystore/
.vitest-secret-token
